      "content": "Welcome to the gym! For your first four weeks, focus on mastering the form of squats, bench press, and deadlifts, even if you have to use very light weight initially. Aim for 3 sets of 5 repetitions for each exercise, three times a week with a rest day in between. To ensure linear progression, try to add a small amount of weight or complete one extra rep on each lift every single week. Remember that proper form is far more important than heavy weight when starting out!",
