      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds doable. can u give me a more specific schedule? like what should i do on monday wednesday and friday specifically? and maybe some advice on how to handle it when the weights start feeling really heavy and i feel like i cant finish my last rep?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
