      "content": "Your simplified schedule could be Monday, Wednesday, and Friday, alternating your main focus slightly, but keep the core lifts consistent. On these days, perform your prescribed sets and reps, perhaps adding some light accessory work like rows or overhead press afterward. If you hit a heavy rep you can't finish, it's okay; focus on controlling the weight down for good form. Instead of risking injury, safely lower the weight for that set, and aim to hit the target reps with the slightly reduced weight next time.",
